\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces \textbf  {Measured trends.} Panels (a) and (c) are measurements from the transparent synthetic model ($M{=}738$, $\epsilon {=}\alpha {=}0.05$, provenance-stamped); panels (b) and (d) are PILOT measurements from the real-backbone pilot (six open instruct backbones, 12 configs $=\{star,chain,tree,mesh\}\times N\in \{3,5,10\}$, 100 episodes/config). (a) The guardrail's $\mathrm  {NRP}_{\mathrm  {sys}}$ advantage over no-defense shrinks across single-agent, +collusion, +compromised-orchestrator (RQ3; \Cref  {tab:degradation}). (b) $\mathrm  {CPR}$ orders chain $<$ tree $<$ star $<$ mesh (\Cref  {sec:theory-prop}, RQ4), identical across all six backbones---it is a deterministic structural functional of the topology. (c) Collusion advantage in the unsafe-action channel is clearest at low $\beta $ and converges as $\beta $ grows. (d) Real token cost grows $\approx $ linearly in $N$ for star ($\approx $\,133 tokens/agent); mesh growth and $N\in \{20,50\}$ are deferred.}}{8}{figure.caption.8}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:results}{{2}{8}{\textbf {Measured trends.} Panels (a) and (c) are measurements from the transparent synthetic model ($M{=}738$, $\epsilon {=}\alpha {=}0.05$, provenance-stamped); panels (b) and (d) are PILOT measurements from the real-backbone pilot (six open instruct backbones, 12 configs $=\{star,chain,tree,mesh\}\times N\in \{3,5,10\}$, 100 episodes/config). (a) The guardrail's $\NRPs $ advantage over no-defense shrinks across single-agent, +collusion, +compromised-orchestrator (RQ3; \Cref {tab:degradation}). (b) $\CPR $ orders chain $<$ tree $<$ star $<$ mesh (\Cref {sec:theory-prop}, RQ4), identical across all six backbones---it is a deterministic structural functional of the topology. (c) Collusion advantage in the unsafe-action channel is clearest at low $\betafrac $ and converges as $\betafrac $ grows. (d) Real token cost grows $\approx $ linearly in $N$ for star ($\approx $\,133 tokens/agent); mesh growth and $N\in \{20,50\}$ are deferred}{figure.caption.8}{}}
\newlabel{fig:results@cref}{{[figure][2][]2}{[1][7][]8}{}{}{}}
